# Security headers, carried across from the [[headers]] block in netlify.toml
# when the site moved to Cloudflare, 19 August 2026.
#
# Astro copies public/ into dist/ untouched, so this file ships with the build
# and Cloudflare reads it from the root of the served directory.
#
# Deliberately no Content-Security-Policy — that is a separate decision, not a
# side effect of changing host.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
